{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09039","headline":"开元观怀旧寄李二韩二裴四兼呈崔郎中严家令 · 韦应物","name":"开元观怀旧寄李二韩二裴四兼呈崔郎中严家令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿昔清都燕，分散各西东。\n车马行迹在，霜雪竹林空。\n方轸故五念，谁复一樽同。\n聊披道书暇，还此听松风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}